Crop of the Players Committee card image [[:File:V9-D-lieutenantvenka.gif]] (after the change to [[Lieutenant Venka (V) (Errata)]]): pixels 0–745 × 553–1039 of the 745×1039 image. Cropped only; no other edits.

Source: <code>Images-HT/starwars/Virtual9-Dark/large/lieutenantvenka.gif</code> in the Players Committee's Holotable image repository, commit [https://github.com/swccgpc/holotable/commit/6489b69cc5f1545e5e24ac7b2d68ae446cf03769 6489b69] (10 July 2022).

